/T (1.1 Theoretical Background of Smart Cities The concept of a "Smart City" revolves around the integration of Information and Communication Technology \(ICT\) and various physical devices connected to the Internet of Things \(IoT\) network to optimize the efficiency of city operations and services. The primary goal is to improve the quality of life for citizens and the sustainability of urban environments. Smart mobility is a cornerstone of this vision. )
/E (1.1 Theoretical Background of Smart Cities The concept of a "Smart City" revolves around the integration of Information and Communication Technology \(ICT\) and various physical devices connected to the Internet of Things \(IoT\) network to optimize the efficiency of city operations and services. The primary goal is to improve the quality of life for citizens and the sustainability of urban environments. Smart mobility is a cornerstone of this vision. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
