/E (Currently, the traffic multipliers are based on historical datasets. While these are accurate for predictable patterns \(like rush hour\), they do not account for spontaneous events such as a sudden vehicle breakdown or an unplanned protest. The system is "predictive" rather than "real-time" in its current iteration. )
