/Title (Our project fits into this paradigm by providing an analytical framework for "Intelligent Transport Systems" \(ITS\). By using graph-based analysis, we can simulate traffic flows, predict bottlenecks, and offer decentralized routing solutions that spread the traffic load more evenly across the urban grid. This proactive approach to traffic management is a significant departure from the reactive measures commonly seen in traditional city management.)
